flowchart LR
  U[Authorized upload intent] --> Q[Quarantine object]
  Q --> V{Type, size, magic bytes, checksum valid?}
  V -- No --> X[Reject and audit]
  V -- Yes --> S[Malware scan interface]
  S --> C{Clean?}
  C -- No or unknown --> I[Isolate or fail safely]
  C -- Yes --> A[Accept immutable original]
  A --> E[Text, layout, and OCR adapter]
  E --> D[Classify with abstain state]
  D --> N[Normalize while preserving offsets]
  N --> P[Flag injection indicators]
  P --> K[Structure-aware chunking]
  K --> M[Attach tenant, policy, version, access, provenance metadata]
  M --> F[Build PostgreSQL FTS representation]
  M --> B[Embedding gateway]
  B --> G[Store pgvector embedding]
  F --> R[Versioned index manifest]
  G --> R
  R --> T{Quality and completeness checks pass?}
  T -- Yes --> READY[Mark index version ready and publish event]
  T -- No --> PARTIAL[Mark partial or failed; retry or review]

  DB[(PostgreSQL metadata)] --- V
  OBJ[(S3-compatible object storage)] --- Q
  OBJ --- A
  AUDIT[Audit and OpenTelemetry] -. observes .-> U
  AUDIT -. observes .-> READY
  AUDIT -. observes .-> PARTIAL
